DTSTART:20270120T115900Z
DTEND:20270120T125900Z
SUMMARY:[Evolutionary Computation & Optimization][Machine Learning] GECCO 2
 027 - Abstract registration for full papers (estimated)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Genetic and Evolutionary Computation Conferen
 ce\nWebsite: https://gecco-2027.sigevo.org/HomePage\nSource URL: https://
 gecco-2026.sigevo.org/Important+Dates\nLocation: Krakow\, Poland\nTopics:
  Evolutionary Computation & Optimization\, Machine Learning\, Complex Sys
 tems & Network Science\nSize: L\nSubmission type: Paper-based / poster pa
 pers\nConfidence: estimated\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Organi
 zer confirms Krakow\, Jul 12-16\, in person. The 2027 CFP still contains 
 copied 2026 venue/deadline text\; do not treat it as a confirmed 2027 sub
 mission schedule. Deadlines use 2026 timing as an estimated annual proxy.
  Poster-only submissions are separate from the gated full-paper route. Si
 ze L is an editorial estimate\; no attendance count is asserted.\nScope: 
 Genetic and evolutionary computation\, including genetic algorithms\, gen
 etic programming\, swarm intelligence\, evolutionary multiobjective and c
 ombinatorial optimization\, metaheuristics\, and neuroevolution. Machine 
 learning is relevant through evolutionary learning and optimization\, not
  as an unrestricted substitute for the conference's evolutionary-computat
 ion focus.\nAdditional topics: Deep Representation Learning\, Learning Th
 eory & Statistical Foundations\nScope sources (2026): https://gecco-2027.
 sigevo.org/Call+for+Papers\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://gecco-2026.sigevo.org/Important+Dates
END:VEVENT
